<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The World Forgetting, By the World Forgot</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;When Catra and Adora first met, they believed they were soul mates. After an awful fight, Adora is forced to reckon with the idea that the love of her life chose to literally delete her from her memories. What was Adora to do but the exact same thing? Prime Enterprises offered the perfect treatment to heal her pain and let her start life anew. Only, it didn't go exactly as planned, and nothing is as it seems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This an AU that combines She-Ra with the film: Eternal Sunshine of the Spotless Mind. However, it is not a total copy of the movie. It is a borrowing of the core idea and theme.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You can erase someone from your mind. Erasing them from your heart is another story.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>motherofchimeras</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Explicit</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow/Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Hordak (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Entrapta (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angst with a Happy Ending</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Let Catra (She-Ra) Say Fuck</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Alternate Universe - Modern Setting</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Sad start with a soft ending I promise</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>No Archive Warnings Apply</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Human Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Memory Loss</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Memory Alteration</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow &amp; Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra &amp; Glimmer Friendship (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra &amp; Bow Friendship</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>GlimBow are the heroes we need and deserve</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Plot Twists</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fake Science</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Established Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Occasional skippable smut</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Inspired by Eternal Sunshine of the Spotless Mind</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Bag>
      </dc:subject>
      <dc:publisher>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Archive of Our Own</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Bag>
      </dc:publisher>
